      <activity id="bdf8a8f9-06f5-57d4-a6d9-49cac9436db6" activityNameId="91f80c8a-13fc-53b7-a741-b061cdabe4fc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Horse dung and wood chips, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Horse dung and wood chips, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 1000kW;
UUID: 58894b7a-c85b-3f56-8a7d-46979db83e90
This data set includes fuel, infrastructure, ash disposal and air emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: grate firing 500-600 kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_58894b7a-c85b-3f56-8a7d-46979db83e90.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
